---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Privacy
description: The privacy policy of each Lunabit Labs app.
permalink: /privacy/
---
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 56px;">
  <div class="narrow">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Lunabit Labs</p>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);">Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our apps have no ads and no third-party trackers, and we don't sell anything about you. Each app's own policy says exactly what it keeps and where.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="post-list">
      {%- for app in apps %}
      {%- if app.privacy %}
      <li><a href="{{ app.privacy }}"><h2>{{ app.name }} Privacy Policy</h2></a></li>
      {%- if app.terms %}
      <li><a href="{{ app.terms }}"><h2>{{ app.name }} Terms of Service</h2></a></li>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
